Package: dynavlan
Version: __VERSION__
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: netplan.io (>= 0.106), tcpdump, lldpd, systemd
Maintainer: Jonathan Perel <pereljon@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/pereljon/dynavlan
Description: Automatic VLAN setup for headless Linux boxes
 Finds the tagged VLANs on each trunk that a box is connected to and
 configures them with DHCP. By default, each VLAN gets an address only,
 with no routes or DNS. Reverts any change that breaks the uplink.
 No SSH or hand-edited YAML.
